// The ARMS RACE (GDR-0092 step 7): the starter (the rim skiff) against an enemy population that evolves against it in
// the same run, bred from the automaton raider and hunter with the warden's shields in their palette, every design
// symmetric. Your children fight a raider pair and the enemy's best two and one past champion (packs sized to them, the
// casual stand-in flying the even seeds); its children fight your best two, one of your past champions and your
// start; every second generation both bests fight the other's champions (PAST CHAMPIONS). Small, so
// `scripts/determinism-check.sh --run arms_race` runs it natively and in wasm, straight and resumed, and compares
// (`docs/arena.md` "Co-evolution").
// `cargo run --release -p arena-cli -- evolve crates/core/arena/runs/arms_race.ron --save /tmp/arms_race.ron`
// PLACEHOLDER numbers (the pilot's are lab.ron's casual).
(
    seed: 1,
    evolve: MayChange(()),
    generations: 5,
    population: 6,
    trials: [
        (
            preset: "enemy_ships",
            kind: EnemyShips(opponents: [(design: Ship("automaton_raider"), count: 2)]),
            seeds: 1,
            time_limit: 30,
        ),
        (
            preset: "arms_race",
            kind: CoEvolution,
            seeds: 2,
            time_limit: 30,
            flown_by: Both((profile: "casual", flies: (lock: true, close_to: 0.8, stick: Some((on: 3, off: 3)), fire: Some((on: 3, off: 2))))),
        ),
    ],
    starts: [Design(design: Ship("rim_skiff"))],
    enemy: (
        starts: [Design(design: Ship("automaton_raider")), Design(design: Ship("automaton_hunter"))],
        population: 4,
        palette: ["shield_emitter"],
        mirror: true,
        elites: 2,
        hall: 1,
        check_every: 2,
        champions_every: 1,
    ),
)
